From 26ff93c903d55b0712c6fb3f6b254710edb971d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wallyworld <ian.booth@canonical.com>
Date: Wed, 17 Dec 2025 08:53:14 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 001/136] fix: only allow users with write permission to upload
 resources We were using a single resource handler for both upload and
 download. But these operations need different permission checks. For upload,
 only users with model write access can upload.

---
